            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/554290/extras/6192b1749a8a83c4d95430de5361ada1.avif?t=1779077201\" alt=\"Let&#039;s Build A Rocket And Go To The Moon\" width=780 height=429 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even though the crash of a spaceship left you without memories or parents, you still couldn't stop dreaming about the stars. As you spent your days trying to build a rocket to the moon with your best friend - the son of a key astronaut who died in a tragic accident - your stargazing catches the crash of another space vessel, and your rescue of the girl within sets in motion a story leading into the future and drawing on your forgotten past.<br><br>Can you confront your past mistakes? Accept those of others? <br><br>What secrets await on the moon?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/554290/extras/eadd43d24ce3ce5e0097cf53bbd9fb90.avif?t=1779077201\" alt=\"Key Features\" width=780 height=404 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/554290/extras/eaab763544d34123172a22e778a4c6f6.avif?t=1779077201\" alt=\"Three Cute Heroines  Aries - The Mysterious Girl From Space  Aqua - The Girl Harboring Many Secrets  Asuka - The Childhood Friend And Tomboyish Heiress\" width=776 height=1656 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/554290/extras/c7db92ea38f07e6295a6e2a852b2fab5.avif?t=1779077201\" alt=\"A Deep, Sci-Fi Tale Of Romance, Growth, and Hardship\" width=780 height=429 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each new chapter, the characters gain more depth and more is revealed about this world set in 2050. While there is light-hearted romance to be found, the full stories and growth each character will stick with you long afterward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/554290/extras/2bc340f1b360ddda6d7df829ece8eea6.avif?t=1779077201\" alt=\"Multiple Endings  Each chapter and route generally follows one main path, even the consequences of poor decisions will prove revealing and add to the story.\" width=780 height=559 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/554290/extras/d8bf4ceabf8f317702de308e1d8e7375.avif?t=1779077201\" alt=\"Full Voice Acting\" width=780 height=429 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the characters are voiced - even the protagonist - featuring talent such as Tamura Yukari, Nonaka Ai, Kawasumi Ayako, and more.</p>",
            "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/554290/extras/6192b1749a8a83c4d95430de5361ada1.avif?t=1779077201\" alt=\"Let&#039;s Build A Rocket And Go To The Moon\" width=780 height=429 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even though the crash of a spaceship left you without memories or parents, you still couldn't stop dreaming about the stars. As you spent your days trying to build a rocket to the moon with your best friend - the son of a key astronaut who died in a tragic accident - your stargazing catches the crash of another space vessel, and your rescue of the girl within sets in motion a story leading into the future and drawing on your forgotten past.<br><br>Can you confront your past mistakes? Accept those of others? <br><br>What secrets await on the moon?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/554290/extras/eadd43d24ce3ce5e0097cf53bbd9fb90.avif?t=1779077201\" alt=\"Key Features\" width=780 height=404 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/554290/extras/eaab763544d34123172a22e778a4c6f6.avif?t=1779077201\" alt=\"Three Cute Heroines  Aries - The Mysterious Girl From Space  Aqua - The Girl Harboring Many Secrets  Asuka - The Childhood Friend And Tomboyish Heiress\" width=776 height=1656 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/554290/extras/c7db92ea38f07e6295a6e2a852b2fab5.avif?t=1779077201\" alt=\"A Deep, Sci-Fi Tale Of Romance, Growth, and Hardship\" width=780 height=429 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each new chapter, the characters gain more depth and more is revealed about this world set in 2050. While there is light-hearted romance to be found, the full stories and growth each character will stick with you long afterward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/554290/extras/2bc340f1b360ddda6d7df829ece8eea6.avif?t=1779077201\" alt=\"Multiple Endings  Each chapter and route generally follows one main path, even the consequences of poor decisions will prove revealing and add to the story.\" width=780 height=559 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/554290/extras/d8bf4ceabf8f317702de308e1d8e7375.avif?t=1779077201\" alt=\"Full Voice Acting\" width=780 height=429 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the characters are voiced - even the protagonist - featuring talent such as Tamura Yukari, Nonaka Ai, Kawasumi Ayako, and more.</p>",
